---
import { siteConfig } from '../data/services';
import { ArrowUpRight, Github } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<footer class="border-t-2 border-[#161513] bg-[#161513] text-[#FAF7F0]" id="tentang">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Sunburst Emblem -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#DE5D35] text-[#FAF7F0] flex items-center justify-center font-black">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12 2l2.4 4.8 5.3-2.1-2.1 5.3 4.8 2.4-4.8 2.4 2.1 5.3-5.3-2.1-2.4 4.8-2.4-4.8-5.3 2.1 2.1-5.3-4.8-2.4 4.8-2.4-2.1-5.3 5.3 2.1z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <span class="font-serif font-black text-3xl tracking-tight text-[#FAF7F0]" translate="no">
            KUBIKO
          </span>
        </div>
        
        <p class="text-sm text-[#A8A29E] leading-relaxed max-w-sm text-pretty">
          Portal mandiri keluarga untuk hiburan bersama, penyimpanan foto dan berkas, serta utilitas praktis tanpa gangguan komersial.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-3">
          <a 
            href="https://github.com/muhaliakbar14-cyber/kubiko" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-stone-700 bg-stone-900 hover:bg-[#EAA838] hover:text-[#161513] hover:border-[#161513] flex items-center justify-center text-[#FAF7F0] transition-[background-color,color] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]"
            aria-label="Kunjungi repositori GitHub Kubiko"
          >
            <Github class="w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          </a>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#A8A29E]">v1.0 • SSG Powered</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigasi Cepat -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#EAA838] font-bold">NAVIGASI</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#D6D3D1]">
          <li><a href="#services" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">Layanan Utama</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">Fitur Keluarga</a></li>
          <li><a href="#panduan" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">Panduan Akses</a></li>
          <li><a href="#subdomain-routes" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">Alamat Web</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Layanan Cepat -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#EAA838] font-bold">LAYANAN</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#D6D3D1]">
          <li>
            <a href="https://nonton.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">
              <span>Nonton Film & Video</span>
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 text-[#A8A29E]" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://files.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">
              <span>Penyimpanan Berkas</span>
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 text-[#A8A29E]" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://pdf.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">
              <span>Pengolah Dokumen PDF</span>
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 text-[#A8A29E]" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://crafty.kubiko.my.id" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]">
              <span>Server Minecraft</span>
              <ArrowUpRight class="w-3 h-3 text-[#A8A29E]" aria-hidden="true" />
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Circular Badge Stamp -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col items-center md:items-end justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-[#EAA838] flex items-center justify-center text-center p-2">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center animate-spin-slow pointer-events-none">
            <svg class="w-full h-full text-[#EAA838]" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
              <path id="circlePath" d="M 50, 50 m -35, 0 a 35,35 0 1,1 70,0 a 35,35 0 1,1 -70,0" fill="transparent"/>
              <text class="text-[9px] uppercase font-mono font-bold tracking-widest" fill="currentColor">
                <textPath xlink:href="#circlePath" startOffset="0%">
                  • KUBIKO MANDIRI • 100% BEBAS IKLAN 
                </textPath>
              </text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-serif font-black text-[#DE5D35]">✦</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-stone-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-[#A8A29E]">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} <strong class="text-[#FAF7F0]" translate="no">kubiko.my.id</strong>. Hak Cipta Terpelihara untuk Keluarga.
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a 
          href={siteConfig.statusPageUrl} 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-[#EAA838] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#EAA838]"
        >
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-status-online inline-block" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span>Status Uptime Kuma</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
